---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import DitherThumb from '../components/DitherThumb.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const projects = await getCollection('projects');
const selected = ['reframed', 'forgeframe', 'creature'].map((slug) => projects.find((p) => p.slug === slug)!);
const essays = (await getCollection('essays'))
  .filter((e) => e.data.status === 'published')
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.date.localeCompare(a.data.date))
  .slice(0, 3);
---

<Page title="Alexander Campos" description="Software, operations, and writing about the systems we depend on. Work and research by Alexander Campos, Virginia.">
  <section class="intro">
    <h1>Alexander Campos</h1>
    <p class="lede">I work on the gap between what software can do and what people can actually use.</p>
    <p>
      I’m in Virginia. Six years in regulated finance taught me to build for
      bad data, awkward handoffs, and someone asking how the number was produced.
      I also build software of my own.
    </p>
    <p>
      As intelligence gets cheaper, I’m interested in what turns it into a
      useful outcome: infrastructure, capital, data, permissions, and a way to
      reach the people who need it. I want to build at those points.
    </p>
    <p class="intro-links"><a href="/work">Work and experience</a><a href="/about">More about me</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="current-research">
    <h2 id="current-research">What I’m thinking about</h2>
    <a href="/research/claims-capacity-collateral" class="entry">
      <h3>Claims, capacity, and collateral</h3>
      <p>Following the distance between promised compute, working infrastructure, and the useful work that pays for it. Who controls that conversion, who captures the value, and who carries the risk?</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="selected-work">
    <h2 id="selected-work">Some things I’ve built</h2>
    <div class="work-list">
      {selected.map((p) => (
        <a href={`/projects/${p.slug}`} class="entry project-card">
          <DitherThumb slug={p.slug} />
          <div>
            <h3>{p.data.title}</h3>
            <p>{p.data.tagline}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="more"><a href="/projects">All projects</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="writing">
    <h2 id="writing">Writing</h2>
    <div class="writing-list">
      {essays.map((e) => (
        <a href={`/writing/${e.slug}`} class="entry">
          <h3>{e.data.title}</h3>
          <p>{e.data.subtitle}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="more"><a href="/writing">All writing</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section closing">
    <p>There are also <a href="/work#orellana">tools for a landscaping business</a>, some <a href="/influences">books</a>, and the music playing here. Oliver is the dog.</p>
    <p>If something here overlaps with what you’re working on, <a href="mailto:alex@campos.works">write to me</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .intro .lede { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.55rem); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--glow-hot); max-width: 38rem; margin-bottom: 1.3rem; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .intro > p:not(.lede) { max-width: 65ch; }
  .intro-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; padding-top: 0.3rem; }
  .intro-links a, .more a { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .home-section { margin-top: 3.3rem; }
  .home-section > h2 { margin: 0 0 1.6rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .work-list, .writing-list { display: grid; gap: 1.65rem; }
  .entry { display: block; border: 0; text-decoration: none; }
  .entry h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
  .entry p { color: var(--white-60); margin: 0; max-width: 63ch; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .entry:hover { border: 0; text-decoration: none; }
  .entry:hover h3 { color: var(--gold-accent); }
  .project-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; align-items: center; }
  .more { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; }
  .closing { max-width: 64ch; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .home-section { margin-top: 2.6rem; }
    .project-card { grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
    .project-card :global(.dither-thumb) { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
  }
</style>
